            {"author": "Herman Melville", "work": "The Confidence-Man", "quote": "The eccentric philosopher would **monologuize** by the hour, expounding his utopian schemes to the bewildered passengers."},
            {"author": "Henry James", "work": "The Portrait of a Lady", "quote": "She allowed him to **monologuize** freely, studying his mannerisms with quiet detachment."}
