            {"author": "George Bernard Shaw", "work": "Major Barbara", "quote": "The industrialist stood **unapologetic** before his critics, declaring that modern civilization rested upon iron and gunpowder."},
            {"author": "Joseph Conrad", "work": "Under Western Eyes", "quote": "Her posture was proud and completely **unapologetic**, defying the harsh scrutiny of the revolutionary tribunal."}
